      "review_description": "It will be installed next week (its a new house under construction). Very high quality frame (Schletter) and very high quality panels (SolarWorld Sunmodule+ 290W Mono; by going for the extra-efficient panels we could one panel less, conserving roof space for the future); chose the Enphase 'ecosystem' because we like the idea of AC wiring despite the small losses in efficiency. The Enphase batteries are also attractive because they are modular. The software monitoring package is good too so we can measure our usage for a few months before deciding how many batteries to go for.",
